WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:04.520
Hey David, I know people are talking about
martial law and Trump canceling the election.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:09.980
What's really the craziest thing that Trump
could do before the 2020 election?

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
So listen, here's the important thing to understand.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:19.710
I agree with many in our audience that Donald
Trump has the potential to be erratic, dangerous

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:27.710
and destructive because of how unhinged he
is becoming due to the impeachment trial that

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:34.800
is upcoming due to the, you know, embarrassment
that he, I think recognizes he has become

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.269
the laughing stock stock.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.690
He has become in front of many of our world
allies.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:45.039
I agree that he has the potential to act in
really erratic, unhinged, dangerous ways.

00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:49.819
Some of the things that he could do and then
we'll get into how likely these things are.

00:00:49.819 --> 00:00:52.090
There's the idea he could cancel the 2020
election.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:56.359
He could cancel it on the basis that, you
know, Ukraine has hacked it and it's not going

00:00:56.359 --> 00:00:57.949
to be fair or something like that.

00:00:57.949 --> 00:01:03.069
Uh, he could cancel it on the basis that while
a president is under impeachment, there couldn't

00:01:03.069 --> 00:01:05.850
possibly be a fair, like he could try to do
that.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:06.850
What do you succeed?

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.210
I don't think so.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.490
The other idea is could Trump Trump declare
martial law either before the election or

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:13.490
after the election?

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.880
The question here is before the election,
sure.

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.880
He could try to do it.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.300
You do need congressional approval for martial
law.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.850
We talked last week or the week before.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:23.901
If you go back and look at other instances
where martial law has been declared in the

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:27.729
United States, it's been really, when there
have been emergencies.

00:01:27.729 --> 00:01:32.070
Now, often martial law was used to do really
horrible things like after the bombing of

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.039
Pearl Harbor as an example.

00:01:34.039 --> 00:01:38.329
Um, so that's another possibility Trump would
need to do that.

00:01:38.329 --> 00:01:41.840
And I don't think that a democratic Congress,
which we will have up until the 2020 election

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.409
is going to be willing to do that.

00:01:44.409 --> 00:01:48.429
Another thing Trump could do is try to get
States to cancel elections.

00:01:48.429 --> 00:01:49.840
So we've already seen that.

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:54.380
There have been some States where the Republican
party has been canceling the Republican primary

00:01:54.380 --> 00:02:01.549
to prevent any kind of, um, uh, a challenge
to Donald Trump, uh, in the Republican primary

00:02:01.549 --> 00:02:03.390
within those, those States.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:08.210
Uh, the, the idea that would be the next step
would be go to red States that have, you know,

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:14.060
really solidly red, a Republican governor
and a Republican controlled legislature house

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:19.830
Senate and try to cancel the election at the
state level all together.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.580
This seems number one, extremely unlikely.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:25.840
And number two actually counterproductive
because if only red States cancel the election,

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:27.120
that's not good for Donald Trump.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.470
So I don't see that as a likely scenario either.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:33.530
Another possibility that's been floated around
is something that wouldn't be unique to Donald

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.530
Trump.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:37.430
It would be getting some kind of military
engagement bombs.

00:02:37.430 --> 00:02:45.520
Someone start a war Curry favor as a wartime
president to try to justify this totally ridiculous

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.940
notion of we don't want to change horses midstream.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:53.730
You know, if your horse is failing you and
you would die if you stay on the horse, but

00:02:53.730 --> 00:03:00.320
maybe you can swim to safety, you might try
to change horses midstream to use that analogy.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.330
That is always a possibility.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.630
How many countries have been possibilities
for this many?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.230
It's are Trump talked about Venezuela.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.570
Trump has talked about Iran.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:13.190
Trump has talked about North Korea.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:16.050
There's a long list that's always sort of
a possibility.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:21.710
I actually think that the more dangerous scenario
would be one that's less cartoonish in nature.

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:26.030
I don't think martial law is likely, I don't
think canceling elections is likely.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:29.650
Imagine that Donald Trump has acquitted in
the Senate impeachment trial, which is the

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:38.160
most likely scenario that could set him off,
not by anger, but into this kind of manic

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:42.110
imaginary mandate that he might believe he
has.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:45.470
Even if more than half the country wants him
impeached and removed because Republicans

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:48.910
control the Senate, they can acquit him very,
very simply.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:55.540
I fear that he will become even more of a
megalomaniac by being acquitted and start

00:03:55.540 --> 00:04:00.550
doing all sorts of crazy things with regard
to our allies, maybe executive orders and

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:06.960
policy and that would get less attention than
something as as notable as I'm declaring martial

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:07.960
law.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:12.350
I'm trying to cancel an election and it could
actually succeed in doing quite a bit of damage.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.350
We will see.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:13.357
I hope none of these things happen.

